      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Replace FetchContent with ExternalProject for vllm-flash-attn.\r\n- Build vllm-flash-attn in an isolated CMake scope.\r\n- Preserve the pinned Flash-Attention commit.\r\n- Support both local `VLLM_FLASH_ATTN_SRC_DIR` and Git-based sources.\r\n- Preserve FA2, FA3, and FA4 CuteDSL installation handling.\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n\r\nCloses #9129\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- `git diff --check` passes.\r\n- Tested ExternalProject configuration with the actual Flash-Attention source.\r\n- Verified generated ExternalProject configure/build/install targets.\r\n- Verified the corrected CMake install prefix.\r\n- CPU-only vLLM CMake configuration succeeds on macOS.\r\n- CUDA compilation could not be performed locally because the development machine is Apple Silicon without CUDA.",
